---
// Agentic System, section 01: how a recall query travels. Markup only.
// Styles live in src/styles/agentic-system.css, loaded by src/pages/projects/agentic-system.astro.
---
<figure class="ags-recall" aria-labelledby="ags-recall-cap">
  <figcaption id="ags-recall-cap" class="ags-fig-cap">
    <span class="ags-fig-kicker">How a lookup travels</span>
    <strong>One question, two kinds of search, one short answer list</strong>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="ags-recall-grid">
    <div class="ags-recall-query">
      <span class="ags-step-label">Example question</span>
      <strong>“What did we decide about this?”</strong>
    </div>

    <ol class="ags-recall-lanes">
      <li class="ags-lane ags-lane-exact">
        <span class="ags-step-label">Exact keywords</span>
        <strong>Finds the literal term</strong>
        <span>Such as a domain name, spelled exactly</span>
      </li>
      <li class="ags-lane ags-lane-meaning">
        <span class="ags-step-label">Meaning</span>
        <strong>Finds the same idea in other words</strong>
        <span>A decision I describe differently today</span>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="ags-recall-merge">
      <span class="ags-step-label">Merge and trim</span>
      <strong>Ranked together</strong>
      <span>Near duplicates removed so new information is not crowded out</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ags-recall-out">
      <span class="ags-step-label">Result</span>
      <strong>A short list the agent can act on</strong>
      <span class="ags-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ags-stores">
    <div class="ags-store ags-store-echo">
      <span class="ags-store-name">Echo</span>
      <span class="ags-store-what">Original session transcripts, kept as they were said</span>
      <span class="ags-store-num"><strong>200,796</strong> searchable transcript chunks</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ags-store ags-store-hippo">
      <span class="ags-store-name">Hippocampus</span>
      <span class="ags-store-what">Curated rules, facts, decisions and procedures</span>
      <span class="ags-store-num"><strong>25,863</strong> memory rows</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="ags-fig-foot">Counts from the September 14, 2026 inspection. They show scale, not accuracy.</p>
</figure>
